1b:T4f3,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Is Yenching Academy a scholarship for any master's subject?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. Applicants may have different undergraduate backgrounds, but the Yenching degree is an interdisciplinary master's in China Studies. Show a clear connection to that academic purpose."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is second-year Yenching funding automatic?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The FAQ says eligible students in good academic standing who remain in Beijing can apply for second-year support. Read those conditions and the eventual award terms instead of assuming unconditional renewal."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Does Yenching still require TOEFL 100?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The current page distinguishes the newer TOEFL scale from a defined window of older scores. Check its exact test-date and delivery rules; do not rely on an undated TOEFL 100 summary."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is the deadline in Pakistan?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"30 November 2026 at 09:00 Beijing time is 30 November at 06:00 Pakistan Standard Time. It is a morning deadline, so do not wait until that evening."}}]}1:["$","main",null,{"id":"main-content","className":"editorial-page scholarship-release editorial-page--guide","children":[[["$","script","0",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/scholarships/yenching-academy/\",\"name\":\"Yenching Academy Scholarship 2027: application and funding\",\"description\":\"Check Yenching Academy's 2027 deadline, research statement, English evidence, partner-university route and conditions for second-year fellowship funding.\",\"url\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/scholarships/yenching-academy/\",\"inLanguage\":\"en\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-11-03\",\"dateModified\":\